    </div>
    <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left">
      <span data-id="pg074_n0007">Mira dhe Nili po luanin dhe po b&#xeb;nin gara p&#xeb;r njohuri t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>
      <span data-id="pg074_n0008">Sot, ata vendos&#xeb;n t&#xeb; luanin loj&#xeb;n: Ekonomia e vendit tim.</span>
      <span data-id="pg074_n0009">Mira shkroi p&#xeb;r pun&#xeb;t q&#xeb; kryhen n&#xeb; fshat, kurse Nili p&#xeb;r pun&#xeb;t q&#xeb; kryhen n&#xeb; qytet.</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border-2 border-green-400 bg-white shadow-sm">
    <table class="w-full border-collapse table-fixed max-lg:table-auto">
