          <h3 class="adt-h3 font-medium text-neutral-900" data-id="pg074_n0013">Ekonomia n&#xeb; fshat</h3>
        </th>
        <th class="w-1/2 px-4 py-3 text-left align-top font-normal max-lg:block max-lg:w-full">
          <h3 class="adt-h3 font-medium text-neutral-900" data-id="pg074_n0015">Ekonomia n&#xeb; qytet</h3>
        </th>
      </tr>
      <tr class="max-lg:block">
        <td class="w-1/2 border-r-2 border-green-400 px-4 py-3 align-top max-lg:block max-lg:w-full max-lg:border-r-0 max-lg:border-b-2">
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0019">Njer&#xeb;zit n&#xeb; fshatra m&#xeb; s&#xeb; shumti merren me bujq&#xeb;si, q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; merren me punimin e tok&#xeb;s, rritjen e drith&#xeb;rave, t&#xeb; frutave dhe t&#xeb; perimeve.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0021">Punimi i tok&#xeb;s dikur ishte shum&#xeb; i v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;, sepse punohej vet&#xeb;m me parmend&#xeb; (veg&#xeb;l e thjesht&#xeb; pune).</span> <span data-id="pg074_n0022">Duhej m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; fuqi pun&#xeb;tore dhe shpenzohej m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; koh&#xeb;.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0024">Sot punimi i tok&#xeb;s &#xeb;sht&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; shum&#xeb; m&#xeb; i leht&#xeb; dhe m&#xeb; i shpejt&#xeb;, fal&#xeb; mjeteve m&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rparuara t&#xeb; pun&#xeb;s.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0026">N&#xeb; fshatra nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e popullsis&#xeb; merren me blegtori, pra me rritjen e kafsh&#xeb;ve dhe t&#xeb; shpend&#xeb;ve.</span> <span data-id="pg074_n0027">Ata kan&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rtuar ferma moderne, ku rritin bim&#xeb; dhe rriten kafsh&#xeb; nga t&#xeb; cilat sigurojn&#xeb; produkte ushqimore.</span></p>
        </td>
        <td class="w-1/2 px-4 py-3 align-top max-lg:block max-lg:w-full">
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0030">Njer&#xeb;zit n&#xeb; qytete punojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; fabrika, punishte, uzina, miniera.</span> <span data-id="pg074_n0031">Ata marrin prodhime, t&#xeb; cilat i quajm&#xeb; prodhime industriale.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0033">N&#xeb; qytete &#xeb;sht&#xeb; zhvilluar edhe tregtia, fal&#xeb; shum&#xeb; dyqaneve dhe qendrave tregtare.</span> <span data-id="pg074_n0034">Ato kan&#xeb; mallra q&#xeb; vijn&#xeb; nga vendi yn&#xeb; dhe nga vende t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0036">Dikur njihnim dhe ushqeheshim vet&#xeb;m me frutat dhe perimet e vendit ton&#xeb;, kurse sot shijojm&#xeb; edhe ato t&#xeb; vendeve m&#xeb; t&#xeb; larg&#xeb;ta t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg074_n0037">Po ashtu, edhe prodhimet e vendit ton&#xeb; gjenden n&#xeb; vende t&#xeb; ndryshme t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s.</span></p>
          <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg074_n0039">Njer&#xeb;zit merren edhe me zeje t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span></p>
        </td>
